<dc:title>Zombieproof Medic: How to Keep the Living Living</dc:title>
<dc:language>en</dc:language>
<dc:creator>[Author]</dc:creator>
<dc:publisher>[Publisher]</dc:publisher>
<dc:description>A field manual for keeping the living living: first aid, a cupboard, and the long middle of care. Seventeen chapters, illustrated. Author, dedication, and publisher left blank. Not a substitute for training or a clinician.</dc:description>
